ripts/2019/07/30/bp-plc-bp-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q1","e":"bp","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Looney","x":"With that in mind, we have committed for three months to no BP employee being laid off, so that we can all remain focused on what's most important during this immediate difficult period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/bp-plc-bp-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q1","e":"bp","d":"2020-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"We expect to achieve cash cost savings of around $2.5 billion by the end of 2021 on a base of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/bp-plc-bp-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q2","e":"bp","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"Following the recent announcement of around 10,000 job reductions, the majority of which are expected to occur by the end of 2020, we expect to take a restructuring charge in 2020 of around $1.5 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bp-bp-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q2","e":"bp","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Giulia Chierchia","x":"Digital will be a key enabler of a significant part of the cost savings, which Murray will discuss shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bp-bp-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q3","e":"bp","d":"2020-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bernard Looney","x":"So you know I have some sympathy with people who can see a strong price environment coming here over the next few years -- who knows, but it's certainly possible that we expect to fully capitalize on that and not let increasing cost erode that commodity price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/bp-plc-bp-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q3","e":"bp","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Looney","x":"To set the context, this means that for 2020 cash costs are expected to be down around 30% since 2014, and there is further to go with BP's reinvent program and associated cost reduction gathering momentum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/bp-plc-bp-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q3","e":"bp","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Looney","x":"This program not only supports our commitment to deliver $2.5 billion of pre-tax cash cost savings by the end of 2021 relative to 2019, but it also underpins our target to deliver $3 billion to $4 billion of pre-tax cash cost savings by 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/bp-plc-bp-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q4","e":"bp","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"…in the third quarter and other working capital effects, the absence of the Rosneft dividend, and severance payments for reinvent BP, partially offset by lower tax payments. Organic capital expenditure was $2.9 billion in the fourth quarter and $12 billion for the year, at the lower end of our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/bp-plc-bp-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2020 Q4","e":"bp","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"Of the expected headcount reduction of approximately 10,000 associated with the reinvent program, more than half have already left BP and the remainder will depart during 2021 and early 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/bp-plc-bp-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q1","e":"bp","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"Operating cash flow of $6.1 billion was underpinned by strong business performance and included a working capital build of $1.2 billion with $0.5 billion of severance payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/bp-plc-bp-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q1","e":"bp","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"…quarter, we continue to expect cash flow to be impacted by the $1.2 billion pre-tax annual Gulf of Mexico oil spill payment, further severance payments associated with our reinvent program and a smaller improvement in realized refining margins relative to the quarter-to-date rise in our RMM.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/bp-plc-bp-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q2","e":"bp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"Our cash flow delivery continues to benefit from the progress being made on cash cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/bp-plc-bp-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q2","e":"bp","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"As Bernard said, we have achieved our target of delivering $2.5 billion of cash cost savings on a run rate basis relative to 2019, around six months earlier than originally anticipated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/bp-plc-bp-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q3","e":"bp","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Hodee","x":"And how should we think about the evolution of your natural gas price realization?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/bp-plc-bp-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q3","e":"bp","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bertrand Hodee","x":"Because when I look at your disclosure, obviously, there is Europe gas price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/bp-plc-bp-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q3","e":"bp","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Murray Auchincloss","x":"And we can streamline all the product offers that we have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/bp-plc-bp-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q4","e":"bp","d":"2022-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Looney","x":"In addition, we delivered our target of $2.5 billion of cash cost savings on a run rate basis relative to 2019, ahead of schedule, six months ahead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/08/bp-bp-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BP 2021 Q4","e":"bp","d":"2022-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bernard Looney","x":"Year 2, 2021, was about change, and the largest restructuring in our company's history so that we are organized to deliver.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/08/bp-bp-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[37,1,11177,0,0,0,10903,0],[38,1,12975,0,0,0,12673,95],[40,1,16614,0,0,0,16350,0],[41,1,17058,0,0,0,16730,0],[42,1,20044,0,0,0,19849,0],[43,1,16169,0,0,0,15900,0],[44,1,18929,0,0,0,18635,0],[45,1,16539,0,0,0,16233,0],[46,1,16306,0,0,0,16054,0],[47,1,15397,0,0,0,15118,0],[48,1,20535,0,0,0,20118,0],[49,1,10610,0,0,0,10369,0],[50,1,11951,0,0,0,11661,0]],"cinema":[[37,1,11177,0,0,0,10903,0],[38,1,12975,0,0,0,12673,95],[40,1,16614,0,0,0,16350,0],[41,1,17058,0,0,0,16730,0],[42,1,20044,0,0,0,19849,0],[43,1,16169,0,0,0,15900,0],[44,1,18929,0,0,0,18635,0],[45,1,16539,0,0,0,16233,0],[46,1,16306,0,0,0,16054,0],[47,1,15397,0,0,0,15118,0],[48,1,20535,0,0,0,20118,0],[49,1,10610,0,0,0,10369,0],[50,1,11951,0,0,0,11661,0]],"imax":[[37,1,11177,0,0,0,10903,0],[38,1,12975,0,0,0,12673,95],[40,1,16614,0,0,0,16350,0],[41,1,17058,0,0,0,16730,0],[42,1,20044,0,0,0,19849,0],[43,1,16169,0,0,0,15900,0],[44,1,18929,0,0,0,18635,0],[45,1,16539